  "dct_title_s": "World Minor Island Disputed Areas with Scale Ranking, 1:10 million (2012)",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This polygon shapefile depicts minor islands worldwide that are 2 sq. km. or less in size and are disputed areas. The smallest base unit where multipart polygons per each admin-0 feature is broken apart and given individual scale ranks. These data are represented at 1:10,000,000 scale. This layer is part of the Natural Earth Collection (v.2.0.0).",
    "Natural Earth is a public domain map dataset available at 1:10, 1:50 and 1:110 million scales. Featuring tightly integrated vector and raster data, with Natural Earth you can make a variety of visually pleasing, well-crafted maps with cartography or GIS software."
